      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROADS END (1) got around 400m in a strong 22.75 when winning a Grade 5 at this track last start. Top win latest and looms as the one to beat again. JUMPING OREO (2) missed the hat-trick last start when sixth and beaten 6 lengths (25.17) last time at Sale. Solid record here at the distance winning four races. Expected to run well. MUGSHOT (7) filled a minor placing last start at Traralgon behind Jumbuk Funi (24.27) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Will give a great sight again. LOUD MOUTH LOUIE (8) is in form and must include among the chances.",
